@title Peak-Season Capacity Summary
@subtitle Peak window 2026-11-23 to 2026-12-23
@author Rafael Ostrowski, Network Planning Lead

# Network at a glance

kpi Network utilization | 91.8% | 166,100 of 181,000 parcels a day | neutral
kpi Network headroom | 14,900 | parcels a day | good
kpi Over capacity | Memphis | by 2,200 parcels a day | bad
kpi Seasonal hires | 640 | 210 for Memphis | neutral

Memphis is the one depot over capacity. Tulsa has only 2,400 parcels of headroom. The plan reroutes 2,200 Memphis parcels a day to Tulsa, which leaves both at their limit.

